<description>&lt;p&gt;Hezbollah explosives were seized in two trucks at Lebanese checkpoints, prompting Lebanon's prime minister and security forces to vow thorough investigations. In northern Israel, a teenager was killed and dozens wounded when a Hezbollah submunition exploded in his backpack during a hike near the Lebanon border, leading the IDF chief to order a probe and authorities to consider restricting hikes in the area. Israeli artillery and air strikes continue against Hezbollah positions in southern Lebanon, causing civilian casualties. The conflict has produced 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOQzJBNlJyQlp1RVhtYTVmN0xiNnVEdVdIYW90MDI4Y2JJNVI3clF2N0F0ZEFUbW1FcXBjTUUwTUdKdWY4ZzFTZmE2MjQtN0I2WERkQkRSd1ZPMUhrTnlJcGMtNHJBRnNVMEtYNXlnY0ZoX0JpMkRRekV4OTRlQklrc0FxdzRlOVVwQmJ0VEhWbk02eTRrbTZxU2lyUGxkVU9JcFoyR2N6OV9YTzlQSEZSWU5oRTZ5eDQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxQM3d6aWxkd2MtMy1SVmp1bGRFTDFyRmNxOGlQdUZwcmZwNUlLa2xRVlJ3cm9sOExPZ25XRDU1bEhBcFkyY2lkam5VREY3QzNtSXVodkxIUVVMQVBhM2t3ZEZzaTBFSnduekFTWW4zTmFFaGJ6MTVnc3R3T1RCbG1xQ18ydXFBMV92cmtOUUd3NHFiWkp2MVRYYmtXRGRXdTdEMnBFRXdkd2pXV09IeTVCZlUxSjY1SGpOV1NjOWkyckFMTHdPS3dvbHB4V0k?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNamVsVF9EY1JVeDlLNGgwbi1jQWZWTlY4b3U4RG